{
  "version": 1,
  "params": {
    "article": {
      "label": "Article",
      "type": "buttons",
      "options": [
        "Albert Einstein",
        "Marie Curie",
        "Ada Lovelace"
      ],
      "value": "Albert Einstein"
    }
  },
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": "note",
      "widgetType": "markdown",
      "config": {
        "text": "# 👋 Start here\n\nThe simplest board: **pick an article**, the cards follow.\n\n- 🎛️ **Board Controls** writes one board param\n- 📄 **Article Excerpt** and 📊 **Article Pageviews** both reference `{{article}}`\n\nOpen any card's ⚙ to see how. Next: the **translate chain** — `?config=/translate-demo.json`.",
        "refreshSeconds": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pick",
      "widgetType": "boardControls",
      "config": {
        "title": "Pick an article",
        "show": "article",
        "refreshSeconds": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "excerpt",
      "widgetType": "excerpt",
      "config": {
        "article": "{{article}}",
        "project": "en.wikipedia",
        "refreshSeconds": 3600
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "views",
      "widgetType": "pageviews",
      "config": {
        "article": "{{article}}",
        "project": "en.wikipedia",
        "displayMode": "stat",
        "refreshSeconds": 3600
      }
    }
  ],
  "layout": [
    {
      "i": "note",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 12,
      "h": 3,
      "minW": 3,
      "minH": 2
    },
    {
      "i": "pick",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3,
      "w": 3,
      "h": 4,
      "minW": 2,
      "minH": 2
    },
    {
      "i": "excerpt",
      "x": 3,
      "y": 3,
      "w": 5,
      "h": 5,
      "minW": 3,
      "minH": 3
    },
    {
      "i": "views",
      "x": 8,
      "y": 3,
      "w": 4,
      "h": 4,
      "minW": 2,
      "minH": 3
    }
  ]
}
